Z||000001||Gokart||02-27-2000||05:00 AM||||WOW DAD! Looks like your ready for summer already! The scoop looks awesome and I like the sticker on the windsheild, but I can't make out what it says. What's it mean? Where did you get your carbon fiber kit? Pictures came out crystal clear!||||reg||14
Z||000002||Monkeyman||02-27-2000||06:42 AM||||Looks like it says, "Dimension X".<P>DAD--Is that an '86 SE (looked like what was on the sail panel) or an '85 GT?||||reg||1
